// and Java front-ends, lexer, parser, bytecode compiler, serializer),
// compiled by Quantum's own C/C++ front-end:
//   qrun src/tools/selfhost/quantumc.cpp <file> <out.qbc>
// writes the same bytes as `qrun --emit-qbc <file> <out.qbc>`.
